---
description: API, data, authorization, and secrets
globs: ["apps/api/**", "apps/media-worker/**", "libs/**", "prisma/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Use NestJS Fastify, Prisma, and PostgreSQL. Enforce API authorization. Use secure cookie sessions.
Do not log credentials, tokens, cookies, or sensitive bodies. Every mutation defines validation,
authorization, idempotency, operational-event impact, tests, and failure behavior. Never reset a
shared database.
